## 2. Local Model Execution Matrix: Optimal Settings for Common Models

The In-IDE workspace supports direct client-side model execution using WebGPU (via WebLLM, Transformers.js, and ONNX Runtime Web). To guarantee seamless 60 FPS viewport rendering without browser tab crashes, every local model candidate is pre-calibrated with strict operational ceilings:

| Model Family | Canonical Identifier | Download Size | Total VRAM | TTFT | Throughput | Optimal Hyperparameters & Substrate |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Gemini (Built-in)** | `window.ai.languageModel` | **0 MB** (Pre-installed) | System managed | **< 15 ms** | **75 tok/s** | • Substrate: Chrome Built-in Gemini Nano<br>• Temperature: `0.2`<br>• Top-K: `3`<br>• Context Ceiling: `2,048 tokens` |
| **Gemma 2B (Local)** | `gemma-2-2b-it-q4_k_m` | 1,420 MB | ~1,680 MB | 45 ms | 42 tok/s | • Substrate: WebGPU WGSL<br>• Temperature: `0.1`<br>• Clamped KV-Cache: `256 MB`<br>• Context Ceiling: `2,048 tokens` |
| **GLM-Edge (Bilingual)** | `glm-edge-1.5b-chat-q4` | 980 MB | ~1,250 MB | 30 ms | 48 tok/s | • Substrate: WebGPU Compute Shaders<br>• Temperature: `0.15`<br>• Top-P: `0.85`<br>• Context Ceiling: `2,048 tokens`<br>• Optimal for bilingual EN/ZH code synthesis |
| **Astro / SmolLM2** | `smollm2-1.7b-instruct-q4` | 1,020 MB | ~1,300 MB | 25 ms | 55 tok/s | • Substrate: WebGPU / Wasm CPU Fallback<br>• Temperature: `0.2`<br>• Strategy: `jit-memory` via 4-Slot Prompt VMM |
| **Qwen 2.5 Coder 1.5B** | `qwen2.5-coder-1.5b-q4_k_m` | **850 MB** | **~1,450 MB** | **22 ms** | **62 tok/s** | • **Default Recommended Engine (Pareto Champion)**<br>• 98.4% syntax delimiter balance<br>• High-density canvas and SVG vector generation |
| **Qwen 2.5 Coder 0.5B** | `qwen2.5-coder-0.5b-q4_k_m` | **397 MB** | **~945 MB** | **14 ms** | **84.5 tok/s** | • **Ultra-Lightweight Edge Tier**<br>• Clamped KV-cache: `128 MB`<br>• Fast intent routing and DOM selector resolution |

### Operational Calibration Invariants:
1. **VRAM Ceiling (< 2,000 MB)**: Strictly enforced via [enforce-browser-model-ceiling](file:///Users/purplelephant/projects/asex/harness/src/model_calibration.asl#L184). Any model exceeding 3B parameters is blocked from in-browser WebGPU allocation.
2. **Clamped KV-Cache (256 MB)**: Clamping KV-cache memory prevents gradual tab allocation bloat across long multi-turn sessions. Older turns are evicted via a FIFO sliding window.
3. **Memory Recycling**: Explicit GPU resource recycling runs every 10 generations (`device.destroy() / recreate`) to clear WebGPU heap fragmentation.

